s</a><header class=3D"mt-6 mb-8"><h1 class=3D"text-4xl font-medium tracking=
-[-0.025em]">How to Add Subtitles to Video with FFmpeg</h1><p class=3D"mt-3=
 text-lg text-muted-foreground">Complete guide to adding subtitles with FFm=
peg =E2=80=94 hardcode SRT/ASS, softcode subtitle tracks, style customizati=
